WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 13=

01:36.760 --> 01:38.550
Do you even know
what a male escort house is?

01:38.560 --> 01:39.560
Of course I do.

01:39.840 --> 01:41.040
A place for male companions.

01:41.520 --> 01:43.000
Then why are you enjoying it so much?

01:43.560 --> 01:44.580
Since we're already here,

01:44.760 --> 01:45.959
we should blend in.

01:46.120 --> 01:48.040
Otherwise it'll be too easy
to expose ourselves.

01:48.560 --> 01:49.760
You just enjoy watching them.

01:50.319 --> 01:51.359
You really do know me well.

01:54.519 --> 01:55.359
Still looking?

01:58.520 --> 02:00.040
You're better looking than all of them.

02:00.200 --> 02:01.159
Shen Zhinian.

02:02.280 --> 02:03.719
I'm helping you carry out your task.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.680
This place only receives female guests.

02:05.680 --> 02:06.719
If a man wants to enter,

02:06.720 --> 02:08.600
he can only come
as a female guest's attendant.

02:08.879 --> 02:10.080
If I act too serious,

02:10.080 --> 02:11.599
won't people grow suspicious?

02:12.000 --> 02:12.919
How do you know that?

02:13.180 --> 02:14.120
You've been here before?

02:14.680 --> 02:15.360
Guess.

02:15.790 --> 02:16.960
The auction's about to begin.

02:19.199 --> 02:19.960
Mm.

02:22.479 --> 02:23.479
We'll split up.

02:23.660 --> 02:24.639
Stay here and keep watch.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.400
Don't let anyone buy the item.

02:26.639 --> 02:27.159
Yes.

02:27.800 --> 02:28.360
Wen Ling,

02:29.400 --> 02:30.680
go scout the surroundings.

02:30.800 --> 02:31.400
Yes.

02:39.479 --> 02:41.680
Young Master,
Jiang Fu and Lu Jianglin are here.

02:48.039 --> 02:49.159
They're Father's men.

02:50.680 --> 02:52.840
Luckily Jiang Fu has never met me before.

02:53.680 --> 02:55.639
What exactly is being auctioned tonight?

02:55.960 --> 02:57.319
Should we notify His Majesty?

02:58.850 --> 02:59.919
Let's wait a little longer.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.660
We'll see once the auction begins.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.120
Mm.

03:07.240 --> 03:08.599
So it's fruit wine.

03:09.080 --> 03:11.199
Rich aroma. A fine wine.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.759
Your injuries haven't healed yet.

03:12.759 --> 03:13.719
You shouldn't drink.

03:14.240 --> 03:15.000
Your Majesty,

03:16.500 --> 03:18.520
this is my first time attending
a lantern festival.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.080
My first time entering
a male escort house.

03:20.080 --> 03:21.800
My first time drinking
in a pleasure house.

03:22.680 --> 03:26.159
I used to think
people should always live by the rules.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.879
But now I feel

03:28.159 --> 03:29.520
that while we're alive,

03:29.719 --> 03:30.560
we should see more

03:31.199 --> 03:32.039
and experience more.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.319
Cold hearted.

03:39.879 --> 03:40.919
Sharp tongued.

03:42.840 --> 03:43.639
Shen Zhinian,

03:43.700 --> 03:46.190
I think sneaking out of the palace
has truly made you fearless.

03:49.580 --> 03:50.439
Seal it with a stamp.

03:50.479 --> 03:53.290
In my next life, I'll become a leopard
and come find Your Majesty again.

03:58.199 --> 03:59.199
Seal it with a stamp.

03:59.560 --> 04:01.120
In the next life,

04:01.280 --> 04:03.000
Mother can be my daughter.

04:05.000 --> 04:06.550
How many people are you trying to stamp?

04:06.840 --> 04:07.520
Ah?

04:08.680 --> 04:09.479
Nothing.

04:12.319 --> 04:13.439
The auction begins now.

04:14.240 --> 04:15.120
The first item,

04:15.130 --> 04:17.550
a gold bracelet once owned by
an imperial consort of the former dynasty.

04:17.560 --> 04:19.199
Starting bid, one hundred taels.

04:20.300 --> 04:21.920
- Is this the item?
- Two hundred taels.

04:22.160 --> 04:23.279
Three hundred taels.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.199
Any higher bids?

04:25.519 --> 04:26.439
No.

04:26.680 --> 04:28.040
Three hundred taels, first call.

04:28.040 --> 04:29.360
Do you really recognize the item?

04:29.800 --> 04:31.279
Three hundred taels, second call.

04:31.839 --> 04:33.000
Sure...

04:33.160 --> 04:34.800
- Sure...
- Fine. Four hundred taels.

04:36.279 --> 04:38.399
You'd better handle this properly.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.879
If we return empty handed tonight...

04:41.000 --> 04:41.720
Six hundred taels.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.279
Then prepare to lose your head.

04:43.279 --> 04:44.120
Seven hundred taels.

04:44.120 --> 04:45.560
Yes.

04:46.279 --> 04:47.120
Sold.

04:48.240 --> 04:48.839
Second item,

04:49.439 --> 04:50.360
Wen Qianji.

04:51.000 --> 04:53.710
This item was handcrafted by
an imperial consort of the former dynasty.

04:53.720 --> 04:56.040
Playing with it daily
can make the fingers slender

04:56.040 --> 04:57.199
and the skin smooth as jade.

04:57.600 --> 04:58.439
This is the item.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.879
Starting bid,

04:59.879 --> 05:00.600
one hundred taels.

05:02.940 --> 05:03.780
(One hundred taels)

05:04.279 --> 05:05.800
Room Xing bids one hundred taels.

05:09.759 --> 05:10.639
Room Yue,

05:10.639 --> 05:11.439
three hundred taels.

05:13.399 --> 05:14.879
Room Xing, four hundred taels.

05:15.680 --> 05:17.439
Room Yue, eight hundred taels.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.720
If this bidding keeps going,

05:24.720 --> 05:26.290
it'll be disadvantageous to Your Majesty.

05:27.040 --> 05:28.040
Do you have a plan?

05:30.399 --> 05:31.040
Who is it?

05:31.600 --> 05:32.120
Oh dear.

05:32.240 --> 05:34.399
Sorry, wrong room.

05:36.920 --> 05:39.040
The young escort beside you, Madam,

05:39.040 --> 05:40.120
is exceptionally handsome.

05:40.160 --> 05:42.079
Why have I never seen him before?

05:45.120 --> 05:46.279
I brought him with me.

05:48.519 --> 05:51.480
Madam, would you be willing
to let me have him?

05:53.040 --> 05:53.480
Get lost.

05:54.090 --> 05:55.240
Please don't be angry, Madam.

05:55.240 --> 05:56.000
I'll leave at once.

05:56.279 --> 05:57.000
Leaving now.

06:01.759 --> 06:02.600
Still outside?

06:03.079 --> 06:03.959
Room Xing,

06:03.959 --> 06:04.800
one thousand taels.

06:04.810 --> 06:06.090
What are you standing there for?

06:06.399 --> 06:07.439
Pour me some wine already.

06:07.439 --> 06:08.720
One thousand five hundred taels.

06:10.759 --> 06:12.959
Room Xing, two thousand taels.

06:15.480 --> 06:16.360
Drink up.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.279
And this is how you're serving me wine?

06:19.199 --> 06:20.079
I'm not drinking.

06:20.079 --> 06:22.120
Don't use this as an excuse
to stir up trouble.

06:22.399 --> 06:23.800
Doesn't Your Majesty want

06:24.160 --> 06:25.160
to stall for time

06:25.560 --> 06:27.120
so Jiang Chen can keep bidding?

06:54.300 --> 06:55.940
I deeply regret
disturbing you earlier, Madam.

06:55.959 --> 06:57.639
I've come especially

06:57.920 --> 06:59.720
to offer you a toast.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.759
The young escort beside you, Madam,

07:06.759 --> 07:08.160
is truly stunning.

07:08.399 --> 07:10.000
I wonder whether Madam would be willing

07:10.000 --> 07:11.279
to let me join in?

07:11.360 --> 07:12.279
Absolutely not.

07:13.199 --> 07:14.920
He's my favorite little companion.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.079
I don't share.

07:18.720 --> 07:20.639
What a pity.

07:27.120 --> 07:28.120
And who might you be?

07:29.319 --> 07:30.519
He's my little companion too.

07:40.560 --> 07:43.439
Madam, you certainly have exquisite taste.

07:43.680 --> 07:44.879
Why aren't you coming over?

07:45.800 --> 07:47.000
Learn from your older brother.

08:01.560 --> 08:03.240
Then I won't disturb you any longer.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.759
Madam, please enjoy yourselves.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.120
What do we do now?

08:20.439 --> 08:21.319
Drink.

08:25.319 --> 08:26.160
Madam.

08:28.580 --> 08:29.360
What are you doing?

08:29.839 --> 08:31.319
Wasn't I supposed to serve Madam wine?

08:31.560 --> 08:32.519
Drink it yourself.

08:38.519 --> 08:40.799
Then should I remove my clothes as well?

08:42.399 --> 08:43.240
That's unnecessary.

08:45.200 --> 08:46.720
I was only asking.

08:52.720 --> 08:54.600
Didn't I tell you
to stay downstairs and bid?

08:54.960 --> 08:55.879
Why did you come up?

08:56.200 --> 08:57.720
I left Luo Hao downstairs to wait.

08:58.160 --> 09:00.399
But the price has already
risen to ten thousand taels.

09:01.159 --> 09:02.320
I didn't bring enough silver.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.559
According to Jinsong Pavilion's rules,

09:04.560 --> 09:06.620
you must have enough silver
on hand to place a bid.

09:07.360 --> 09:09.990
So I came up to ask Your Majesty
whether you've brought enough silver.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.799
Let them bid.

09:13.759 --> 09:16.159
Room Xing bids thirteen thousand taels.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.559
Any higher bids?

09:19.159 --> 09:20.840
Thirteen thousand taels, first call.

09:21.159 --> 09:22.799
Thirteen thousand taels, second call.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.879
Thirteen thousand taels, third call.

09:25.919 --> 09:26.759
Sold.

09:27.600 --> 09:28.879
Good.

09:30.639 --> 09:32.360
Thirteen thousand taels

09:32.960 --> 09:34.600
for this worthless thing.

09:36.039 --> 09:37.080
Lu Jianglin,

09:37.440 --> 09:40.159
if this doesn't contain
what Duke Zhen wants,

09:40.799 --> 09:43.919
I'll have you torn apart
and fed to the dogs.

09:44.120 --> 09:44.879
Yes.

09:47.559 --> 09:49.080
How do you open this thing?

09:56.399 --> 09:57.519
I don't know either.

09:57.960 --> 09:58.720
Move aside.

10:26.679 --> 10:28.120
- Farewell, Your Majesty.
- Farewell, Your Majesty.

10:35.799 --> 10:37.000
No idea what it even is.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.090
His Majesty wants it,

10:38.279 --> 10:39.320
and so does Duke Zhen.

10:39.330 --> 10:41.180
Willing to spend
over ten thousand taels on it.

10:41.519 --> 10:42.559
The military tally.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.399
What?

10:43.750 --> 10:45.960
Although His Majesty
controls the troops in the capital,

10:46.000 --> 10:48.560
they're nowhere near strong enough
to rival the Zhen State Army.

10:48.879 --> 10:51.519
That's how he maintained peace
with Father before.

10:52.000 --> 10:54.190
But Father's ambitions
are growing greater and greater.

10:54.480 --> 10:56.480
If His Majesty wishes
to contend with him,

10:57.240 --> 10:58.440
he must find the Chifeng Army

10:58.440 --> 10:59.990
left behind by his maternal grandfather.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.600
But didn't the Chifeng Army

11:01.600 --> 11:02.759
get wiped out ten years ago?

11:03.000 --> 11:04.130
The commander died in battle,

11:04.570 --> 11:07.000
and the remaining forces scattered
across different regions.

11:07.370 --> 11:09.120
As long as
the military tally is recovered,

11:09.159 --> 11:10.360
they can all be gathered again.

11:10.759 --> 11:12.590
If the box truly contains
the military tally,

11:13.320 --> 11:14.919
then war may break out very soon.

11:15.799 --> 11:17.000
For Young Master,

11:17.399 --> 11:18.480
would that be good or bad?

11:18.919 --> 11:19.679
What do you think?

11:20.200 --> 11:22.690
Everyone says Young Master
is indifferent to fame and ambition,

11:22.720 --> 11:23.600
gentle and righteous,

11:23.919 --> 11:25.240
and even turned against Duke Zhen

11:25.240 --> 11:26.320
to protect His Majesty.

11:27.440 --> 11:30.159
But I feel that you
have plans of your own.

11:30.279 --> 11:31.879
Everyone has plans of their own.

11:32.520 --> 11:33.840
Send a secret message to Father.

11:34.100 --> 11:35.990
The military tally has fallen
into His Majesty's hands.

11:36.200 --> 11:37.780
What do you mean by this, Young Master?

11:49.660 --> 11:51.950
(I never expected that
after searching for so many years,)

11:52.279 --> 11:54.159
(I would truly find it.)

11:57.840 --> 12:00.240
Is Your Majesty unable to open the box?

12:01.120 --> 12:02.159
Want to give it a try?

12:02.919 --> 12:03.720
Yes.

12:04.070 --> 12:05.480
If you open it, you'll be rewarded.

12:05.919 --> 12:07.240
If you fail,

12:07.440 --> 12:08.840
then you'll be punished.

12:13.039 --> 12:15.080
This looks like a puzzle box.

12:15.090 --> 12:16.860
As long as the characters
are arranged correctly,

12:16.879 --> 12:18.360
it should open.

12:20.879 --> 12:22.440
(These characters together...)

12:22.759 --> 12:25.639
(sound like a song
from my previous life.)

12:26.799 --> 12:28.000
Phoenix.

12:28.679 --> 12:30.000
Perches.

12:30.320 --> 12:31.279
Parasol.

12:33.399 --> 12:34.679
Long.

12:35.399 --> 12:36.559
Night.

12:37.799 --> 12:38.919
Bright.

12:40.919 --> 12:42.639
(She actually knows the secret code?)

12:43.720 --> 12:44.679
It opened.

12:49.039 --> 12:51.120
Is this what Your Majesty
has been searching for?

12:55.000 --> 12:56.440
Then today, I've completed

12:56.440 --> 12:58.039
the task Your Majesty assigned me.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.200
Your Majesty,

12:59.679 --> 13:01.399
may I have my death-exemption medal now?

13:12.560 --> 13:17.680
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:19.400 --> 13:24.640
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:26.280 --> 13:28.640
♪If we don't meet♪

13:28.840 --> 13:32.080
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:32.280 --> 13:38.800
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:39.160 --> 13:45.600
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:45.960 --> 13:52.280
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:52.800 --> 13:59.480
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:59.480 --> 14:06.360
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

14:06.600 --> 14:12.480
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

14:13.400 --> 14:20.000
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:20.160 --> 14:26.840
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

14:27.120 --> 14:33.560
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
